cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository version and the associated TVC manuscript. If you use Original FDPL or the earlier dual-branch study, also cite the CMC 2026 paper listed in README.md."
title: "Residual FDPL: Reference Implementation for the TVC Study"
abstract: "Reference implementation of Residual Frequency Domain Perception Loss for real-world image denoising. This software accompanies the TVC manuscript 'Residual Frequency Domain Perception Loss for Real-World Image Denoising with Adaptive Spectral Supervision'. The earlier Original FDPL method is described in the CMC 2026 paper 'A Lightweight Dual-Branch CNN with Frequency Domain Perception Loss for Image Denoising'."
